      "content": "scale back from the fight... what does that even mean? like just walk away? i cant just walk away from my life and my housing and my legal status. there's nowhere to go. it feels like the only way to actually stop the loop and the pressure is to just... not be part of it anymore. to just stop existing so the machine can't touch me anymore. is that even a real option? or am i just being crazy?",
